    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Schedule a 30-minute consultation.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Free, no commitment. We will walk through your situation and confirm whether we are a fit.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule Now</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609300,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609301,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's the difference between private label and contract manufacturing?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Private label uses our existing formulations with your brand on the label. Contract manufacturing typically refers to producing to your specifications (your formulation, your packaging, your everything). We do both. Most clients start with private label and add contract manufacturing as they grow.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can you handle custom formulations from concept to production?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of supplement formulations across most major categories. We work from your concept (or just your audience pain point) through formulation, stability testing, scale-up, and production.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How does intellectual property work with custom formulations?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Your formula is your IP. We document it in a way that you own and could (in theory) take to another manufacturer. We don't claim ownership over formulations we develop for clients.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's the minimum production run for contract manufacturing?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Custom formulation has higher minimums than private label, typically in the low thousands of bottles per SKU. The exact number depends on the formulation complexity and packaging. We give you specific numbers during scoping.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How long do contract manufacturing projects typically take?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">12 to 16 weeks from project kickoff to first production run. The timeline includes formulation development, ingredient sourcing, stability testing, manufacturing scale-up, and first batch production. Faster is possible for simpler formulations.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
